    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_cT0X9SSp3DlWBJI",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID4",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "Instructions Below are 50 vague promptschart plan generated by a large language model (LLM). Thes...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#e8f4fd; border:1px solid #b6d4fe; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:24px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#0b6fa4; margin:0 0 12px; font-size:22px;\">Instructions</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:8px 0; font-size:16px; color:#333;\">\n      Below are <b>50 vague prompts</b that we collected from real user inquiries.  \n      For each prompt, you will also see the <b>chart plan generated by a large language model (LLM)</b>.  \n      These charts are based on a dataset that can support the suggested visualizations.\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin:12px 0; font-size:16px; color:#333;\">\n      Your job is to <b>rate whether you agree with the LLM’s output plan</b>.  \n      Please be <b>generous in your judgment</b> — the plan does not need to be perfect.  \n      As long as the suggested charts are <b>reasonable and relevant</b> to the vague prompt, you may consider them acceptable.\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin:12px 0 0; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold; color:#444;\">\n      You will rate each plan on:\n    </p>\n    <ul style=\"margin:8px 0 0 20px; padding:0; color:#333; font-size:15px;\">\n      <li><b>Does the generated chart plan match the intent of the vague prompt?</b> (1 = Not at all, 7 = Completely)</li>\n      <li><b>Does the generated chart plan have the potential to support further exploration?</b> (1 = Not at all, 7 = Definitely)</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n",
        "DefaultChoices": false,
        "DataExportTag": "A-0",
        "QuestionType": "DB",
        "Selector": "TB",
        "DataVisibility": {
          "Private": false,
          "Hidden": false
        },
        "Configuration": {
          "QuestionDescriptionOption": "UseText"
        },
        "QuestionDescription": "Instructions Below are 50 vague promptschart plan generated by a large language model (LLM). Thes...",
        "ChoiceOrder": [],
        "Validation": {
          "Settings": {
            "Type": "None"
          }
