      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"I've heard about the diversity you find in Centr...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"I've heard about the diversity you find in Central America.\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Diversity Index by Country in Central America</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Diversity Index by Country in Central America' bar chart shows that among Guatemala, Belize, and El Salvador, Belize has the highest cultural diversity index, making it a potentially enriching destination for travelers interested in diverse cultures.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Visitor Flow and Diversity Index in Central America</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Visitor Flow and Diversity Index in Central America' multi-type chart reveals that while Guatemala and Belize have similar visitor numbers, Belize offers a higher cultural diversity, suggesting a more varied travel experience.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cultural Reviews for Central America</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Pie chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Cultural Reviews for Central America' pie chart indicates that all three countries, Guatemala, Belize, and El Salvador, have received generally positive feedback for their cultural experiences, with Belize slightly leading, reinforcing its appeal for culture-oriented travelers.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
