        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Popular areas don't always fit the budget.\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Popularity vs Cost by Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Popularity vs Cost by Region' chart displays a comparison between the average daily travel cost and the popularity of Asia, Europe, and North America, highlighting that while some regions may be popular, they might also be more expensive.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Budget-Friendly Regions Based on Review Scores</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Budget-Friendly Regions Based on Review Scores' bar chart reveals the regions within your budget that have the highest average review scores, indicating that Asia offers the best value for money.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety Score vs Popularity for Budget Travellers</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety Score vs Popularity for Budget Travellers' scatter plot shows the relationship between the safety scores and the popularity of regions within your budget, suggesting that North America offers a good balance between safety and popularity.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Popularity and Cost Breakdown by Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Pie chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Popularity and Cost Breakdown by Region' pie chart presents a proportional representation of the average daily cost and the popularity of each region, illustrating that while Europe is the most popular, it also has the highest average daily cost.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
