        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Reviews can be variable across continents.\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Review Variability by Continent</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Review Variability by Continent' bar chart reveals how the quality of travel experiences, as indicated by reviews, can differ between Asia, Europe, and North America, helping travelers set their expectations accordingly.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Review Score Distribution by Continent</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Pie chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Review Score Distribution by Continent' pie chart displays the proportion of positive, neutral, and negative reviews each continent receives, giving travelers a snapshot of overall satisfaction rates.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Trends of Review Variability Over Time</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Trends of Review Variability Over Time' line chart shows how traveler reviews for Asia, Europe, and North America have fluctuated over a set period, providing insight into changing travel trends and potential improvements or downgrades in experiences.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Review Score vs Popularity by Continent</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Review Score vs Popularity by Continent' scatter plot compares the average review scores with the popularity of each continent, indicating where high satisfaction levels coincide with high visitor numbers and thus potentially crowded destinations.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
