        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"People often dream of affordable, culturally rich trips. (Cost + Diversity – vague dream)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Average Daily Cost by Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Average Daily Cost by Region' bar chart compares how much you can expect to spend each day in Asia, Europe, and North America, helping you to budget more effectively for your travels.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cultural Diversity Index by Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Cultural Diversity Index by Region' bar chart reveals the cultural richness of Asia, Europe, and North America, offering insights into the variety of experiences you could have in each location.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Popularity vs Safety Score</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Popularity vs Safety Score' scatter plot illustrates the relationship between the safety and popularity of Asia, Europe, and North America, assisting you to weigh up the excitement of a destination against its safety.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Worldwide Travel Cost and Diversity</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Map chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Worldwide Travel Cost and Diversity' map shows the average travel costs and cultural diversity scores around the globe, in places like China, France, and the USA, providing a snapshot of affordability and cultural richness at a glance.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
