      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"Southern climates are often praised for their en...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Southern climates are often praised for their environmental quality. (Env. quality – undefined praise)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Environmental Quality Index by Southern Regions</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The line chart showcases the environmental quality index over time in South America, Southeast Asia, and Southern Europe, revealing trends and potential improvements or declines in each region's environmental health.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Review Scores on Environmental Quality</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The bar chart illustrates travellers' review scores on environmental quality in South America, Southeast Asia, and Southern Europe, providing insights into tourists' satisfaction with the respective environmental conditions.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety vs Popularity in Southern Climates</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The scatter plot compares the safety score with the popularity score for destinations in South America, Southeast Asia, and Southern Europe, offering a perspective on whether safer destinations are more popular among travellers.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cultural Diversity Index by Southern Regions</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The bar chart displays the cultural diversity index by southern regions, highlighting the rich cultural diversity in South America, Southeast Asia, and Southern Europe, which could be a significant factor for travellers interested in cultural experiences.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
