    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_cT0X9SSp3DlWBJI",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID69",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"The most tourist-heavy spots sometimes lack cult...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"The most tourist-heavy spots sometimes lack cultural depth. (Popularity + Diversity – unqualified depth)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Popularity vs Cultural Diversity</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Popularity vs Cultural Diversity' bar chart indicates how popular Paris, New York, and Tokyo are as tourist destinations, and also shows the cultural diversity each city offers. This chart can help you decide if you want a more popular destination or one with varied cultural experiences.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Tourist Spots Popularity over Time</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Tourist Spots Popularity over Time' line chart shows the trend of Paris, New York, and Tokyo's popularity as tourist destinations over a period of time. This can help you identify when these destinations are most frequented, perhaps helping you avoid peak travel times.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cultural Depth vs Popularity</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Cultural Depth vs Popularity' scatter chart reveals the relationship between the cultural depth and popularity of Paris, New York, and Tokyo. This can help you find a destination that balances both cultural richness and popularity.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cultural Depth Breakdown by Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Pie chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Cultural Depth Breakdown by Region' pie chart provides a detailed view of the cultural depth scores for Paris, New York, and Tokyo. This can help you make an informed decision if experiencing a city's culture is a key factor in your travel planning.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
