        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Quality environments tend to receive higher reviews. (Env. quality + Reviews – unqualified observation)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Environmental Quality and Review Score by Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Environmental Quality and Review Score by Region' chart compares the average environmental quality and average review score in North America, South America, and Europe, revealing which regions offer cleaner environments and higher traveler satisfaction.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Review Score Distribution by Environmental Quality</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Review Score Distribution by Environmental Quality' chart shows how review scores spread out based on environmental quality in North America, South America, and Europe, indicating that destinations with higher environmental quality often receive better reviews.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Top Reviewed Destinations by Environmental Quality</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Top Reviewed Destinations by Environmental Quality' bar chart displays top-rated destinations such as New York, Paris, and Sydney that also have high environmental quality, suggesting these places are ideal for travelers seeking both top-notch experience and a clean environment.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Environmental Quality and Review Score Over Time</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Environmental Quality and Review Score Over Time' line chart traces the trend of environmental quality and review scores in North America, South America, and Europe over time, which can help travelers understand if environmental quality and traveler satisfaction have improved or declined in these regions.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
