        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Cultural richness sometimes comes with a hefty price tag. (Diversity + Cost – vague burden)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cultural Diversity vs Average Daily Cost</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Cultural Diversity vs Average Daily Cost' chart compares the cultural richness of Asia, Europe, and North America with the average daily cost of visiting these regions, revealing that greater cultural diversity may come with higher travel expenses.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Popularity vs Safety Score</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Popularity vs Safety Score' scatter plot provides insights into the popularity and safety of travel destinations in Asia, Europe, and North America, with bubble size indicating the volume of reviews, which can help travelers balance their desire for popular destinations with safety considerations.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Environmental Quality Index Over Time</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Environmental Quality Index Over Time' line chart tracks the environmental health in Asia, Europe, and North America over time, enabling eco-conscious travelers to observe the sustainability efforts of these regions.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Region-wise Review Score Breakdown</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Pie chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Region-wise Review Score Breakdown' pie chart shows the distribution of review scores in Asia, Europe, and North America, offering travelers a snapshot of overall traveler satisfaction in these regions.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
