    {
      "SurveyID": "SV_cT0X9SSp3DlWBJI",
      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID105",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"Environmental quality is often perceived as stel...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Environmental quality is often perceived as stellar in the west. (Env. quality – undefined perception)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Environmental Quality Perception across Regions</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The bar chart compares the perceived environmental quality in the West, East, and North, indicating that the West is generally seen as having the best environmental quality. This information could be useful for travelers who prioritize environmental considerations.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Region-wise Breakdown of Environmental Quality Perception</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Pie chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The pie chart provides a breakdown of environmental quality perception by region, allowing travelers to understand the proportion of positive sentiment about environmental quality in the West, East, and North.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Trend of Environmental Quality Perception in the West</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The line graph shows how environmental quality perception in the West has changed over time, which could help travelers anticipate whether the region's environmental quality is improving or declining.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Comparison of Environmental Quality Perception and Popularity Score</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The scatter plot reveals the relationship between environmental quality perception and popularity score across the West, East, and North. This could help travelers identify regions that balance environmental quality and popularity.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
