      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID117",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"Tourists are often surprised by the safety of le...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Tourists are often surprised by the safety of lesser-known areas. (Safety + Popularity – unexpected reassurance)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safe Lesser-Known Regions</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safe Lesser-Known Regions' bar chart reveals that Bhutan, Faroe Islands, and Latvia all have high safety scores, making them secure travel destinations despite being less popular. This could provide an unexpected sense of reassurance for potential visitors.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Popularity of Lesser-Known Regions</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Popularity of Lesser-Known Regions' bar chart indicates that while Bhutan, Faroe Islands, and Latvia may not be as well-known, they still hold a certain level of popularity among those who value unique travel experiences.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety vs Popularity in Lesser-Known Regions</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety vs Popularity in Lesser-Known Regions' scatter chart shows that there is no direct correlation between a region's safety and its popularity. This suggests that travellers might be missing out on safe and enjoyable experiences in less crowded places like Bhutan, Faroe Islands, and Latvia.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
