      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"It’s intriguing when diversity aligns with higher travel costs. (Diversity + Cost – unanticipated alignment)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Diversity Score vs Average Travel Cost by Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Diversity Score vs Average Travel Cost by Region' scatter chart shows how regions with higher diversity scores tend to have higher average travel costs, suggesting that more culturally diverse destinations might require a larger travel budget.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Average Travel Cost by Diversity Category</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Average Travel Cost by Diversity Category' bar chart indicates that travel costs tend to rise as diversity increases, meaning trips to highly diverse regions may be more expensive.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Regional Diversity Index Over Time</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Regional Diversity Index Over Time' line chart reveals how cultural diversity in each region has evolved over the years, which can be helpful for travelers interested in immersing themselves in diverse cultures.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Country Breakdown of High Travel Cost and High Diversity</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Pie chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Country Breakdown of High Travel Cost and High Diversity' pie chart provides a breakdown of countries where high travel costs coincide with high diversity, offering a perspective on where your investment might yield the richest cultural experiences.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
