      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"Sometimes, popular locales struggle with environ...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Sometimes, popular locales struggle with environmental preservation. (Popularity + Env. quality – broad struggle)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Popularity vs Environmental Quality</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Popularity vs Environmental Quality' chart reveals a struggle between tourism and sustainability, showing that popular destinations like Venice, Bali, and Barcelona are dealing with environmental issues, which could impact the quality of your visit.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Visitor Flow vs Environmental Quality</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Visitor Flow vs Environmental Quality' bar chart compares the number of visitors to the environmental quality of Venice, Bali, and Barcelona, indicating areas where heavy tourism might be causing environmental strain.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Environmental Quality Over Time</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Environmental Quality Over Time' line chart demonstrates how the environmental quality of Venice, Bali, and Barcelona has changed over time, which could influence when you decide to visit these destinations.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Region-wise Environmental Quality</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Pie chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Region-wise Environmental Quality' pie chart breaks down the environmental quality of popular destinations like Venice, Bali, and Barcelona by region, helping you to choose a destination that aligns with your eco-friendly travel goals.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
