      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"Safe cities that don't break the bank are highly...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Safe cities that don't break the bank are highly sought after. (Cost + Safety – vague sought)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Average Daily Cost vs Safety Score</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Average Daily Cost vs Safety Score' scatter plot compares the average daily cost of staying in Paris, Tokyo, and New York against their safety scores, showing that high safety doesn't necessarily mean high cost.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety Score by Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety Score by Region' bar chart breaks down the safety scores of Paris, Tokyo, and New York by region, which can be useful in choosing the safest areas to visit in these cities.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cost and Safety Comparison</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Cost and Safety Comparison' multi-type chart juxtaposes the average daily cost and safety scores of Paris, Tokyo, and New York, giving you a comprehensive view of your potential expenses and safety in these cities.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Popularity Score vs Safety Score</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Popularity Score vs Safety Score' scatter plot for budget-friendly cities like Bangkok, Istanbul, and Mexico City reveals that a city can be both popular and safe, highlighting potential destinations for budget travelers who don't want to compromise on safety.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
