      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"Attractions can sometimes underdeliver despite s...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Attractions can sometimes underdeliver despite stellar reviews. (Attractions + Reviews – unclear delivery)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Attraction Review Analysis</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Attraction Review Analysis' bar chart shows the average review scores for three major attractions: the Eiffel Tower, the Colosseum, and the Great Wall of China, helping you decide which one is the most appreciated by previous visitors.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Attraction Delivery Score</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Attraction Delivery Score' scatter plot reveals how well each attraction - the Eiffel Tower, the Colosseum, and the Great Wall of China - lives up to its reviews and expectations, giving you an indication of the likely satisfaction level.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Review vs Delivery Score</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Review vs Delivery Score' multiType chart provides a comparison between the review scores and the delivery scores for the Eiffel Tower, the Colosseum, and the Great Wall of China, helping you understand if the attractions generally meet, exceed, or fall short of visitor expectations.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
