      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Asian travel is perceived as cost-friendly in commentary. (Cost – broad commentary)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Average Daily Cost by Asian Countries</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Average Daily Cost by Asian Countries' bar chart displays the average daily expense for travelers in China, India, and Japan, revealing that India is the most cost-friendly destination amongst them.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cost and Safety Correlation in Asian Countries</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Cost and Safety Correlation in Asian Countries' scatter plot shows that there is a relationship between the average daily cost and safety scores in China, India, and Japan; it suggests that Japan is a safer destination but also more expensive.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cost-Friendly Asian Countries Popularity</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Cost-Friendly Asian Countries Popularity' chart combines data on travel costs and user reviews to show that despite being a cost-friendly destination, India is less popular among tourists compared to China and Japan.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Seasonal Variation of Travel Cost in Asia</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Seasonal Variation of Travel Cost in Asia' line graph displays cost fluctuations throughout the year in China, India, and Japan, indicating that travel costs to these countries tend to be lower during the off-peak seasons.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
