        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Strong environmental ratings frequently parallel good reviews. (Env. quality + Reviews – unqualified parallel)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Environmental Quality vs Reviews</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Environmental Quality vs Reviews' scatter chart reveals a correlation between the environmental quality and traveler reviews for Hawaii, Bali, and Iceland, suggesting that cleaner, more sustainable destinations tend to receive higher reviews.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Average Review Score per Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Average Review Score per Region' bar chart compares average traveler review scores across Europe, Asia, and North America, providing insights on which regions generally offer more satisfying travel experiences.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Average Environmental Quality per Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Average Environmental Quality per Region' bar chart compares the average environmental quality across Europe, Asia, and North America, indicating where travelers can expect better environmental conditions.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Reviews and Environmental Quality over Time</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Reviews and Environmental Quality over Time' multiType chart shows the trends of review scores and environmental quality in Hawaii, Bali, and Iceland over time, allowing travelers to see how these factors have improved or declined.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
