      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"South America’s acclaim is steadily rising. (Pop...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"South America’s acclaim is steadily rising. (Popularity – broad rise)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Popularity Trend of South American Destinations</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Popularity Trend of South American Destinations' line chart reveals that interest in Brazil, Argentina, and Chile as travel destinations has been steadily growing over time. This could be useful for planning trips to these countries during less crowded periods.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cost vs Popularity of South American Destinations</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Cost vs Popularity of South American Destinations' scatter plot shows that there isn't necessarily a direct correlation between a destination's popularity and its daily cost, which can aid cost-effective travel planning.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety Score Comparison of South American Destinations</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety Score Comparison of South American Destinations' bar chart shows that among Brazil, Argentina, and Chile, Argentina has the highest safety score, which could be a deciding factor for safety-conscious travelers.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Environmental Quality of Popular South American Destinations</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Environmental Quality of Popular South American Destinations' multiType chart provides insights into the environmental quality of these destinations. When planning eco-friendly travel, this information can help in choosing a destination with a high environmental quality index.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
