      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Some areas are reportedly rich in safety. (Safety – vague richness)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety Richness by Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety Richness by Region' bar chart shows a comparison of safety levels across Asia, Europe, and North America, providing a clear picture of which region is considered safer for tourists.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety Score Comparison</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety Score Comparison' scatter plot illustrates the safety ratings of various destinations within Asia, Europe, and North America, helping travelers identify the safest locations within each region.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety Trend Over Time</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety Trend Over Time' line graph demonstrates how safety scores in Asia, Europe, and North America have evolved over time, which can be useful in understanding trends and future safety expectations.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety vs Popularity</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety vs Popularity' multiType chart reveals the relationship between a region's safety scores and its popularity among tourists, providing insights into whether tourist hotspots in Asia, Europe, and North America also tend to be the safest.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
