        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Parts of North America are lauded for their cultural diversity. (Diversity – ambiguous lauding)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cultural Diversity Index Across North America</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The bar chart titled 'Cultural Diversity Index Across North America' compares the level of cultural diversity in the USA, Canada, and Mexico, showing which of these regions hosts the most diverse range of cultures.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Popularity Score vs Cultural Diversity in North America</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The scatter plot 'Popularity Score vs Cultural Diversity in North America' illustrates the relationship between a destination's popularity among tourists and its cultural diversity, helping travelers decide where to experience a rich blend of cultures.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cultural Diversity and Environment Quality Trend in North America</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">In the multi-type chart 'Cultural Diversity and Environment Quality Trend in North America', the fluctuating trends of cultural diversity and environmental quality in the USA, Canada, and Mexico are displayed by quarter, indicating the optimal time to visit for a mix of rich culture and good environment.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Review Scores for Diverse Cultures of North America</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Pie chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The pie chart titled 'Review Scores for Diverse Cultures of North America' breaks down the average review scores for the cultural diversity in the USA, Canada, and Mexico, giving travelers an idea of the most well-reviewed region for cultural diversity.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
