      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID169",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"Perceptions of environmentalism vary by country....",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Perceptions of environmentalism vary by country. (Env. quality – underspecified perceptions)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Environmental Quality Perception by Country</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Environmental Quality Perception by Country' bar chart compares how the USA, UK, and Germany are perceived in terms of environmental quality, offering insight into which destination might be more appealing for eco-conscious travelers.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Environmental Quality Perception Over Time</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Environmental Quality Perception Over Time' line chart illustrates how perceptions of environmental quality in the USA, UK, and Germany have changed over the years, helping travelers understand if these countries are improving their environmental practices.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Comparative Analysis of Environmental Perceptions</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Comparative Analysis of Environmental Perceptions' scatter plot provides a direct comparison of environmental quality perceptions between the USA, UK, and Germany, aiding in highlighting the differences or similarities among these destinations.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Worldwide Environmental Perception</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Map chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Worldwide Environmental Perception' map shows the global distribution of environmental quality perceptions, providing a broader understanding of how different countries fare environmentally, which can influence a traveler's choice of destination.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
