      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"Review highlights don’t always mirror the attrac...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Review highlights don’t always mirror the attractions. (Attractions + Reviews – unclear mirroring)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Attraction Popularity vs Review Score</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Attraction Popularity vs Review Score' scatter plot enables us to assess whether the most popular attractions in Paris, London, and New York also receive the highest review scores, supporting travelers in identifying must-visit spots.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Regional Review Score Distribution</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Pie chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Regional Review Score Distribution' pie chart provides a clear view of how travelers rate destinations in North America, Europe, and Asia, helping to guide region-based travel decisions.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Top Reviewed Attractions by Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Top Reviewed Attractions by Region' bar chart showcases the most highly rated attractions in North America, Europe, and Asia, offering insights into top experiences in each region.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Attraction Popularity and Review Score Over Time</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Attraction Popularity and Review Score Over Time' chart illustrates how the popularity and review scores of attractions in Paris, London, and New York have changed over time, which can be an indicator of rising or fading attractions.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
