      "Element": "SQ",
      "PrimaryAttribute": "QID177",
      "SecondaryAttribute": "User's Vague Prompt\n    \n      \"Handling security issues is complex in culturall...",
      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Handling security issues is complex in culturally abundant areas. (Diversity + Safety – indistinct complexity)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cultural Diversity and Safety Complexity</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Cultural Diversity and Safety Complexity' chart showcases the relationship between the cultural diversity index and safety scores in Paris, Rome, and Tokyo, which can help identify regions with a rich cultural backdrop without compromising safety.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety Score Over Time</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety Score Over Time' line graph displays how the safety levels in Paris, Rome, and Tokyo have evolved over a period of time, enabling travelers to understand the safety trend in these cities.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety and Popularity Correlation</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety and Popularity Correlation' scatter plot illustrates the connection between the safety scores and popularity of Paris, Rome, and Tokyo, providing insights into whether popular destinations also score high on safety.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
