      "TertiaryAttribute": null,
      "Payload": {
        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"European nations are regarded for top-tier safety. (Safety – sweeping regard)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">European Nations Safety Ranking</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'European Nations Safety Ranking' bar chart displays the safety scores of France, Germany, and Spain, which can be used to gauge the overall safety of these countries while planning a trip.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety vs Popularity of European Nations</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety vs Popularity of European Nations' scatter plot illustrates the relationship between safety and popularity scores of France, Germany, and Spain, revealing whether popular destinations also have high safety scores.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety Trend of Top European Nations</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety Trend of Top European Nations' line graph showcases the progression of safety scores over time in France, Germany, and Spain, which can be useful in assessing whether these countries are becoming safer travel destinations.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety Score Distribution in Europe</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Pie chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety Score Distribution in Europe' pie chart depicts the proportion of safety scores among France, Germany, and Spain, providing a comparative perspective on safety for travelers choosing between these destinations.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
