        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"Traveler reviews differ in clarity across regions. (Reviews – vague clarity)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Traveler Review Clarity by Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bar chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Traveler Review Clarity by Region' bar chart shows how clear and understandable traveler reviews are on average in Europe, North America, and Asia. This can help you decide which region's reviews are likely to provide the most useful insights for travel planning.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Review Clarity and Popularity Score Relationship</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Review Clarity and Popularity Score Relationship' scatter plot illustrates how the clarity of reviews correlates with a destination's popularity in Europe, North America, and Asia. This could indicate whether clear reviews contribute to a destination's popularity.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Review Clarity Over Time</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Review Clarity Over Time' line graph reveals how the clarity of traveler reviews has evolved over time in Europe, North America, and Asia. This can inform you about trends in review quality and potentially about changes in travel experiences in these regions.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Region-wise Review Clarity and Safety Score</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Region-wise Review Clarity and Safety Score' multiType chart displays both the clarity of reviews and the safety scores for each region. This can help you balance the value of clear reviews with safety considerations when choosing your next travel destination.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
