        "QuestionText": "<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin: 24px auto; line-height: 1.6;\">\n\n  <div style=\"background:#fff3cd; border:1px solid #f0c36d; border-radius:12px; padding:24px; margin-bottom:20px; box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); text-align:center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color:#7a5c00; margin:0; font-size:22px;\">User's Vague Prompt</h2>\n    <p style=\"margin:10px 0 0; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold; color:#333;\">\n      \"The cost of exploring culturally vibrant areas can be surprising. (Diversity + Cost – vague surprise)\"\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"background:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:10px; padding:20px; margin-bottom:24px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color:#0f6cab; margin-top:0; font-size:18px;\">AI-Generated Chart Plan</h3>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Cultural Diversity vs Cost by Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Multi-type chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Cultural Diversity vs Cost by Region' chart compares the richness of cultural diversity and average daily travel cost in Paris, Tokyo, and Marrakech, revealing that cultural richness does not always correlate with higher costs.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Safety vs Popularity vs Review Count</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Bubble chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Safety vs Popularity vs Review Count' scatter plot illustrates the relationship between safety, popularity, and the volume of reviews in Paris, Tokyo, and Marrakech, which can help travelers choose culturally vibrant destinations with a balance of safety and popularity.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Environmental Quality Index by Quarter</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Line chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Environmental Quality Index by Quarter' line chart shows the seasonal changes in environmental quality in Paris, Tokyo, and Marrakech, providing a clear idea of the best time to visit these culturally vibrant areas based on environmental conditions.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">\n      <p style=\"margin:0; font-weight:bold; font-size:16px;\">Review Scores by Region</p>\n      <p style=\"margin:2px 0; color:#555;\"><i>Pie chart</i></p>\n      <p style=\"margin:4px 0;\">The 'Review Scores by Region' pie chart displays the average review scores for Paris, Tokyo, and Marrakech, giving travelers a snapshot of overall tourist satisfaction in these culturally vibrant areas.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
